## Built on Guild

This app was created from guild/starter. When a task touches Guild:

- How the app works (sign-in, authorization, pages, extensions): `vendor/guild/framework/docs/index.md`
- Running it locally, config, secrets, personas: https://github.com/nathanskky/guild-starter/blob/main/docs/index.md
- Each Guild package documents itself at `vendor/guild/<package>/docs/index.md`.
  A link to `github.com/nathanskky/guild-<package>/blob/<ref>/docs/…` is the same file under
  `vendor/guild/<package>/docs/…` at the version this app has installed; prefer the local copy.

Open the index, pick the one page that matches the task, and read only that.
